OL,3,GNEWSAOrange Order says no proposals on
OL,4,Atable to resolve Drumcree dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FTalks aimed at resolving the Drumcree
OL,7,Fdispute are expected to continue, as
OL,8,Fsenior Orangeman Nigel Dawson says
OL,9,F"there are currently no proposals on
OL,10,Fthe table".
OL,12,FBoth the Orange Order and the Garvaghy
OL,13,FRoad Residents' Coalition (GRRC) were
OL,14,Fgiven a document during separate
OL,15,Fmeetings with Northern Ireland
OL,16,FSecretary Sir Chris Bryant on
OL,17,FWednesday.
OL,19,FSpeaking afterwards, the chairman of
OL,20,Fthe residents' coalition said his group
OL,21,Fwould agree to it if the Orange Order
OL,22,Fdid.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
