OL,3,GNEWSAOrange Order says no proposals on
OL,4,Atable to resolve Drumcree dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Sunday, an Orange Order parade from
OL,7,FDrumcree Church into Portadown did not
OL,8,Fhappen due to a large protest on the
OL,9,Fmainly-nationalist Garvaghy Road.
